WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:04.940
As one encounter led to a double romance...

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.740
...three beating hearts...

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.140
...played gentle melodies.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:12.450
I, Kasuga Kyosuke, 15 years old...

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.030
...am living the best years of my youth!

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:30.400
That's the accelerator screamin', as the tires are squealin'...

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:36.960
...takin' you along, a girl I hardly knew,
in my speedin' coupe.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:42.680
You slammed the door,
evadin' the shadows that followed...

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:49.420
...sayin' "Take me anywhere, Just go!"

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.320
An encounter is like a highway junction...

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:55.390
I've fallen in love with you - that I realized...

00:00:55.390 --> 00:01:01.430
...by the time the seaport was in sight...

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:04.530
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:13.310
Sayin' that you desire
tenderness over a caress...

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:16.640
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:25.650
...the way you avoided me, usin' that naive look, wasn't so innocent.

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.960
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:37.730
Sayin' that you desire
a caress over loneliness...

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:41.170
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:51.500
...the way you looked into my eyes as you turned back wasn't so innocent.

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:05.200
A Foreboding Dream?! Hikaru is Dying.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:17.650
"N... No, it can't be! You can't die!"

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:21.920
"I... I... finally realized..."

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:25.460
"...that, without you, Hikaru... I..."

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:29.220
"...I... can't live without you!"

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:32.770
"Darling... I can't hang on any longer..."

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:34.880
"H... Hikaru!"

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:42.980
"Good-bye. I... was happy to be near you..."

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:45.090
"Oh!"

00:02:55.510 --> 00:03:01.070
"Hikaru!"

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:09.070
Hikaru!

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:10.490
Oniichan!

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:11.690
Oh?!
Oniichan!

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:11.760
You weirdo!
Oh?!

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:12.700
You weirdo!

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:13.720
Dummy!
You weirdo!

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:13.800
You weirdo!

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:14.920
Oh! Er...

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:26.400
It's morning...

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:34.420
Oh, c'mon, Oniichan!

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:37.800
How could Hikaru the
"Peppy-All-Day-Girl" die, just like that?!

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:40.460
Sheesh! Well, that's what I thought too!

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:43.490
But, if that's what I saw, what can I do about it?

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:49.640
Still, you shouldn't dismiss your dreams so quickly.

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:50.570
What?!

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:52.500
Creepy! What do you mean, Papa?
What?!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:52.590
What?!

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:58.750
Huh? Well... well, you kids got
your mother's abilities, after all, so...

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:01.970
...perhaps you have the ability to have Foreboding Dreams.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:03.280
"Foreboding Dreams?!"

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:03.610
Uh-huh.
"Foreboding Dreams?!"

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:04.380
It means seeing the future in your dreams.
Uh-huh.

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:07.880
It means seeing the future in your dreams.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.260
Oh, Dad, c...come on!

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:12.920
You never know...

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:16.080
How can you talk about
stuff like that so early in the morning?

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:19.150
Geez...

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:24.530
A Foreboding Dream...

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:27.960
A Foreboding Dream, huh...? That reminds me...

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:32.520
I seem to remember that when I was in pre-school, I had a dream...

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:34.940
...in which I wet my pants
while waiting to use the toilet.

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:41.320
And, when I went to school that day, that's exactly what happened!

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:46.430
I wonder if that was... a Foreboding Dream?

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.520
That means...

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.270
That means...

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:54.730
Hikaru!

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.720
What about Hikaru?
Hikaru!

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:56.800
Hikaru!

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:59.010
What the...?! Yuusaku!

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:01.330
Did something happen to Hikaru?! Hey, you!

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:04.210
Oh, no, no! No! Oh, it's nothing!

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:08.750
Oh, I just remembered!
I have to review my stuff before class!

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:10.870
Later!

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:15.140
Why, that punk...

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:29.890
At any rate, the dream I had was really awful.
And since then, I felt...

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.010
Good morning!

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.400
Darling!

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:38.620
Good morning, Sempai!
I missed you so much that I almost died!

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:40.730
A... Almost died?!

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:44.490
Oh, you're so over-the-top, Hikaru...

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:48.610
We were just together at ABCB, drinking coffee 'til late!

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:53.460
No, I'm not. Even as
well-protected as I am at home...

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:56.930
...if I cannot spend a moment...
just a moment with you at night...

00:05:56.930 --> 00:06:00.130
...that's... that's a tragedy!

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:02.930
Oh! What a sizzling couple!

00:06:02.930 --> 00:06:04.730
It's only morning still!
Oh! What a sizzling couple!

00:06:04.730 --> 00:06:06.400
Stay that way forever!
It's only morning still!

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:06.540
Stay that way forever!

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:07.900
Way to go!
Stay that way forever!

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:07.980
Stay that way forever!

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:08.540
Darling...

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:11.270
H...H...Hey... Hikaru...
Darling...

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:15.750
Never mind that... But, tell me, like,
are you feeling sick, or...

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:17.990
...something like that? Well?

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:21.680
Huh? Me? You're asking me?

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:26.860
O...Oh, c'mon, Sempai!
What're you talking about?!

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:30.700
I still even have my appendix.
Wanna see it?

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:31.530
Oh, how daring! Go for it!

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:35.190
Wh...Whoa! Don't look!
Oh, how daring! Go for it!

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:40.070
If you don't mind...
I'd like to put away my shoes.

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:42.410
A...Ayukawa!

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:44.950
Good morning, Madoka!

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:46.150
Good morning.

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:48.200
Good morning!

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:52.340
This is the last time we're going to tell you that these characters spell "Ayukawa."

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:56.640
You're pretty early today, Ayukawa.

00:06:57.620 --> 00:07:00.390
Should I have gotten here a little later?

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:03.370
Huh? N... I didn't mean it like that...

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:07.730
Say, Darling... Join me
for lunch today, won't you?

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:14.130
You see, I've made a lot of
sandwiches for you, Darling.

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:17.170
Please say yes!

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:19.010
I... I guess so...

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:21.030
YES!
I... I guess so...

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:26.140
At that moment, I was like...

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:31.330
Ayukawa...

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:33.600
Because of the crazy dream I had...

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:35.680
...my previous engagement with Ayukawa got...

00:07:38.230 --> 00:07:42.600
"Cutlet-Sandwich? Oh!
You mean the lunchtime bakery ones?"

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:46.460
"Yup."

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:52.420
"Okay. Sure, let's try to get them
together tomorrow."

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:53.950
"But, it's kinda funny...

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:57.970
"l didn't know you wanted to
fight in the Cutlet-Sandwich War!"

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:11.600
When she broke out in a
seemingly-shy... yet honest smile...

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:16.190
...I felt that this was the first time I'd seen her do that... But, then...

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:35.010
"Let's Self-Study Quietly!"

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:47.430
I gotta apologize to her...

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:59.810
At times like these...
Ayukawa is totally unapproachable, so...

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:03.000
Oh! She's out there! She's out there!

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:06.640
Kurum...y!

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:11.450
She's so full of energy! Manami!

00:09:15.390 --> 00:09:16.360
Mine now!

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:17.720
Oh! You cheater!
Mine now!

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:22.940
You! What do you think you're doing?!

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:24.470
That ball belongs to Kurumi!

00:09:24.470 --> 00:09:26.300
Kn...Knock it off, why don't you?!
That ball belongs to Kurumi!

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:26.380
That ball belongs to Kurumi!

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:31.450
S...Stop handling the ball like that!
Oh, I'm feelin' good!

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:34.070
Not again!

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:44.030
Yeah, there's no way...

00:09:44.030 --> 00:09:46.250
...for such a peppy girl as Hikaru to...

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:49.720
Silly me.

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:00.970
What's wrong?!

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.670
Hikaru! Are you all right?!
What's wrong?!

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:04.040
Oh!
Hikaru! Are you all right?!

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:04.240
Oh!

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:05.000
Oh!
Oh!

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:05.060
Oh!

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:06.240
Oh! Hikaru!

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:08.110
H...Hey!
Stop!

00:10:08.110 --> 00:10:08.190
Oh! Hikaru!

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:08.280
You can't
stop me!

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:10.150
That's
dangerous!

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:10.280
You can't
stop me!

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:12.140
Don't kill yourself
so soon!

00:10:12.140 --> 00:10:13.620
H...Hey...

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:14.240
I'm tellin' ya!

00:10:14.240 --> 00:10:15.350
Wh... What the...?
Hey, Hatta!

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:16.380
Hikaru!

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:21.020
Wh...What are
you doing?!

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:21.450
Gimme them!

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:21.480
Wh...What are
you doing?!

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:21.620
H...Hey...

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:23.250
Wh... What
the...?

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:26.760
Gotcha! Did I fool anybody?

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:37.080
Oops!

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:39.940
"Girls' Locker Room"

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:42.340
My goodness! Is that for real?!

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:46.590
Yup. And, my brother got really worried.

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:48.710
It's so silly of him!

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:55.250
S...S...So, that's it! That explains it...

00:10:56.830 --> 00:11:00.240
"Never mind that... But, tell me, like,
are you feeling sick, or...

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:01.730
"...something like that? Well?"

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.630
I'm speechless!

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:14.240
Hurry up! C'mon, guys!

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:15.580
Charge!
Hurry up! C'mon, guys!

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:25.260
Th...That's mine! I'm buyin' it!

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:27.020
I laid my hand on it first!
Th...That's mine! I'm buyin' it!

00:11:27.590 --> 00:11:31.940
Hey, you! Today's the day Kurumi
and Manami get Cutlet-Sandwiches!

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:34.800
You scum should eat green-pea pastry!

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:36.170
We're gonna die!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:38.100
Let us die for you!
We're gonna die!

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:38.180
We're gonna die!

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:39.200
Do you understand, Hatta?

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:39.400
Yeah!
Do you understand, Hatta?

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:41.470
We're not men, if we let anyone butt in!

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:43.500
I know that!
We're not men, if we let anyone butt in!

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:49.170
What?! Hikaru said what?!

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:54.140
Yeah, she said she's going home 'cause she got a stomach-ache all of a sudden.

00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:59.250
That dream... It was for real!

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:23.540
Oww...

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:25.820
A... Ayukawa!

00:12:25.820 --> 00:12:27.080
Wh... Why you!
A... Ayukawa!

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:28.890
Yu...!

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:30.940
Eat... this!
Yu...!

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:52.670
W... Wait a minute!
Where are you taking me?

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:56.720
To Hikaru's house!
Hikaru had to leave school early!

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:59.220
Hikaru left...?! Get your hands off me!

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:04.570
First of all, why should I go see Hikaru, just because she left school early?!

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:06.800
What? Aren't you worried?

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:10.880
"Worried?" All she had was
a little stomach-ache, right?

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:14.600
Besides, maybe she just wants to skip the afternoon classes!

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:17.590
Ayukawa... you're cold...

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:20.580
Now, wait a second...
Exactly what's going on?!

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:23.920
You make it sound as if Hikaru is about to die or something!

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:28.040
That's exactly it though!
Oh! Er... I mean...

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:29.890
What are you saying?

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:33.900
That she's hiding something,
though I've known her since we were little?!

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:35.100
Right, "Darling?"

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:37.210
A... Ayukawa...

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:39.490
Madoka!

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:42.240
Look at these! Cutlet-Sandwiches!

00:13:42.240 --> 00:13:44.960
Oh! Talk about daring, Yuu!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:46.840
Thank you!

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:49.480
Listen, Yuu, apparently
Kasuga-sempai really wants you to...

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:51.940
...accompany him to a certain place.

00:13:56.410 --> 00:13:58.410
See ya!

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:03.950
I... I bet that this is...
her revenge for this morning... I guess!

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:09.020
I don't need any! No medicine for me!

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:14.980
No, Hikaru! You had to
leave school early, right?!

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:18.090
Geez... She's so picky!

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:24.080
Oh, what can I do...

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:27.300
It's not like it's going to
make me any worse.

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:34.850
Oh, well...

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:42.070
Well, I have to get going...
You're sure you'll be all right?

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:45.670
An appointment that you made
a long time ago, right... with your friends?

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:47.870
It won't do if they're men friends!

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:49.890
Silly!
It won't do if they're men friends!

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:55.800
A-ha! As luck would have it, "El-Picky" is outta here!

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:07.690
"Hikaru..."

00:15:07.690 --> 00:15:10.730
"You've come for me... Kyosuke."

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:14.050
"l knew that... I knew that you'd come for me!"

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:17.530
"Hikaru!"

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:25.760
"Kyosuke..."

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.180
"Ushiko...

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:34.050
"Ushiko, wherefore art thou, Ushiko?"

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:36.940
"Umao, wherefore art thou, Umao?!"

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:41.020
"Hikaru!"

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:43.250
"Kyosuke!"

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:54.630
He's here!

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:00.030
Yes...?

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:11.460
That son-of-a-bitch...

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:14.580
And I was kind enough to
let him know about her... Dammit!

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:20.620
C'mon! How long will it take?!

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:23.620
J... Just a little longer!

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:30.720
You're the one who said that sandwiches aren't good for someone who's sick!

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:34.310
It's just about done!

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:36.880
If you eat them together with a hot bowl of soup, it's good for your tummy...

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:39.000
...I mean, your stomach!

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:45.780
I don't mind, but... I had no idea that you were a decent cook!

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:51.150
Th... Thank you!

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:54.690
This time for sure! It's Darling!

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:00.330
Come on in!

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:03.440
Please! Please come in, Darling!

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:07.530
I don't know if you'll like these,
Sempai, since I didn't make them.

00:17:10.440 --> 00:17:13.380
Please, don't be modest. Help yourself!

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:21.980
At any rate, now that I know that you're well, I'm much relieved.

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:28.350
No... Just a while back,
I felt so bad that I thought that I'd die!

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:33.260
My head felt as if it was
gonna crack open...

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:36.730
Huh? I thought you had
a pain in the stomach!

00:17:37.170 --> 00:17:40.510
Oh! Th...These new illnesses... Well...

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:43.700
I guess the site of the pain
moves around, it seems, I bet!

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:51.990
Here, Darling! Open up, and say "Ah..."

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:53.820
Hikaru...

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:57.380
Oh, come on! You need to
open your mouth wide, or else!

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:03.870
"You're really tellin' me the truth?!"

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:05.570
"Of course it's the truth!"

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:08.410
"Damn! This fortune-teller that you're talkin' about... I'll kick his ass!"

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:12.960
"D...Don't! Anyway, I hear that
this fortune-teller is usually right."

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:15.930
"Besides, Hikaru left school early, so..."

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:21.370
All right, you did well!

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:24.580
Okay, now. Please open wide
once again, okay?

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:38.200
Good afternoon.

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:40.840
Afternoon...

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:43.540
Gee... A slow day?

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:46.610
You'd rather it was busy on a day like this?

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:47.730
Huh?

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:51.710
Oh! Well, it looked like you're in a bad mood, so...

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:53.370
M... Master!

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:05.700
I can't believe that guy!
"Hikaru this, Hikaru that!"

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:07.730
There's a limit to how much one can take!

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:09.500
Welcome!

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.740
Why, you...

00:19:11.740 --> 00:19:13.970
Take that! Ha! I won't let you!

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:17.090
Kaboom! Boom! Boom! I did it!

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:21.450
Umm... I know she said she wanted to go out for some fresh air...

00:19:21.450 --> 00:19:23.140
...but I wonder if this is a good idea?

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:26.720
We've got no choice!
This is what Hikaru wanted!

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:27.750
Oh...

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:28.610
What did I tell ya!
Oh...

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:29.280
Hikaru!
What did I tell ya!

00:19:29.280 --> 00:19:29.410
Hikaru!

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:30.780
Are you all right, Hikaru?!
Hikaru!

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:33.690
Yes?

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:37.210
Oh, shoot... I didn't know that
the pills would make me sleepy!

00:19:39.260 --> 00:19:41.030
Anyway, let's get out of here!

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:42.960
Yeah.
Anyway, let's get out of here!

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:43.040
Anyway, let's get out of here!

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:47.240
I feel bad for Darling, but...
being sick is simply irresistible!

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:48.530
"Burger World"

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:51.100
Here you go! Thank you very much.
It'll be ¥1,250, sir.
"Burger World"

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:51.570
Here you go! Thank you very much.
It'll be ¥1,250, sir.

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:56.180
Ah, yes, yes...

00:19:56.180 --> 00:19:58.820
Here you go, sir. ¥250 is your change.

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:03.070
Sheesh! Why should I have to pay for Yuusaku as well?!

00:20:04.480 --> 00:20:07.250
Hikaru! Hikaru!

00:20:08.090 --> 00:20:10.600
Hikaru! Hikaru!

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:13.930
Hikaru! You've got to hang on! Hikaru!

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:15.200
Hikaru!

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:18.360
Hikaru! Y...You can't die!

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:21.140
Hikaru!

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:25.070
Wh... What's going on?
"Dying?" Who's dying?

00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:27.950
Oh! I forgot, I am!

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:33.030
I beg you, please... please...
let me rest... somewhere peaceful.

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:37.010
Just Darling and I, together...

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:39.980
"T...Together...?!"

00:20:41.190 --> 00:20:43.210
Y...Yuusaku...

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:53.330
Oh, boy... I'm too sleepy... I can't stay awake...

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:12.370
Fine... if that's...
if that's Hikaru's last wish...

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:16.090
Y...Yuusaku...

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:24.600
H...Hikaru...

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:25.970
Oh, Darling...

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:28.630
I... don't think I can hang on any longer.

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:30.760
Hikaru!

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:39.630
"l can't... hang on... any longer..."

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:42.750
"Hikaru!"

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:49.180
Wh... What should I do...? I knew it!
It's just like in the dream!

00:21:50.150 --> 00:21:51.860
Good-bye...

00:21:51.860 --> 00:21:57.160
I... I feel that... it was wonderful to be with you, Darling.

00:21:57.160 --> 00:21:59.770
H...Hikaru!

00:21:59.770 --> 00:22:01.490
Hikaru!

00:22:02.930 --> 00:22:07.280
What?! Then, Kasuga saw Hikaru in a dream, and then he...

00:22:07.280 --> 00:22:10.070
That's right! He's been
upset about it since this morning!

00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:14.040
When Hikaru heard about it, she went gaga!

00:22:14.040 --> 00:22:17.020
What?! Kurumi,
you told her about it?! Yup!

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:20.320
I see...

00:22:20.320 --> 00:22:22.410
That explains it! Huh?

00:22:27.960 --> 00:22:31.600
Oh, no you don't! Anybody trying to enter the park must deal with me!

00:22:31.600 --> 00:22:35.290
W...Wait, Yuu! What in the world
are you doing?!

00:22:36.530 --> 00:22:41.080
M...Madoka! Madoka!

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:44.010
Hikaru is... Hikaru is...

00:22:48.710 --> 00:22:52.060
Hikaru... I've finally realized...

00:22:52.060 --> 00:22:54.160
Hikaru... Without you, I...

00:22:54.160 --> 00:22:57.240
...I... can't live!

00:23:00.160 --> 00:23:01.830
Same here!

00:23:01.830 --> 00:23:02.690
Hikaru!
Same here!

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:04.160
Darling! Huh?!
Hikaru!

00:23:04.160 --> 00:23:04.290
Darling! Huh?!

00:23:04.290 --> 00:23:05.020
Oh!
Darling! Huh?!

00:23:22.480 --> 00:23:25.540
Would you two open
your eyes for a change?!

00:23:31.290 --> 00:23:33.720
But... still...

00:23:39.460 --> 00:23:44.700
Seems... my Power can predict things through Foreboding Dreams, after all.

00:23:54.910 --> 00:24:02.530
I dream of casting a spell that captures your heart...

00:24:02.530 --> 00:24:10.100
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:10.100 --> 00:24:25.450
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory. I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:25.450 --> 00:24:38.060
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:38.060 --> 00:24:48.270
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:48.270 --> 00:24:55.280
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:55.280 --> 00:25:06.680
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:12.960 --> 00:25:15.200
Ayukawa is a girl after all...

00:25:15.200 --> 00:25:17.920
So what if she's wearing a ring or two? There's nothing odd about that.

00:25:18.460 --> 00:25:22.870
But, in addition to that,
if I catch a glimpse of a guy...

00:25:22.870 --> 00:25:26.610
...then, well... I can't help but suspect something.

00:25:26.610 --> 00:25:29.510
Next time: "Don't Ring the Wedding Bell!"

00:25:29.510 --> 00:25:32.630
I... can't calm down.
